+# Fetching notes
+
+Per-domain rate limit the corpus fetch had to respect (Svipall):
+- 12 visits per 60 s window, per domain
+- Breach cooldown: 900 s before that domain could be hit again
+
+Mirror/CDN hosts used to fetch files:
+- raw.githubusercontent.com
+- cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/owner/repo@branch/path
+- cdn.statically.io (slow, prone to timeouts)
+
+Source: project transcript memory (trust 1, tool-observed), not re-verified against Svipall logs for this write-up.
